# Redemption is a commercial COM library, licensed per-developer and not ours to
# redistribute. The DLLs are ~26 MB and are a build/runtime dependency, not source.
# Keep the archive and any extraction out of the repo; record the version in the docs
# that depend on it instead.
Redemption.zip
Redemption*.dll
Interop.Redemption.dll
.local/

# graphify writes graphify-out/ wherever it is invoked. Derived entirely from tracked
# source and regenerated on demand. Bare directory name so it matches at any depth.
graphify-out/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Peeked Service Bus messages, saved before touching the queue. These carry live Graph
# resource ids and subscription ids for real mail - operational scratch, not source.
infra/logicapps/tools/dlq-preserved/

# Ingest working directory: unpacked export packages and extracted messages, up to
# ~204 GB for the full archive. The script now defaults it outside the repo, but an
# explicit -Work could still land it here.
ingest-work/
rse-ingest-work/

# reindex-touch.ps1's record of which blobs it has already touched. Operational state,
# grows to hundreds of thousands of lines, and is rebuildable from blob LastModified.
infra/logicapps/tools/reindex-touched.txt
